---
// Row of piped royal-icing dots: the site's signature divider.
---
<div class="wrap" aria-hidden="true"><div class="piping"></div></div>

<style>
  .piping {
    height: 10px;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, var(--ginger) 2.6px, transparent 3px);
    background-size: 16px 10px;
    background-repeat: repeat-x;
    background-position: center;
    opacity: .55;
  }
</style>
